    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This edition combines\u00a0The Chronicles of\u00a0Lancelot 1 and The Chronicles of Lancelot 2 into one unforgettable, deliciously NSFW fantasy adventure! xD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/0db579b0fd54f9d4bd2e6dbc462a3cb9.avif?t=1753101609\" width=600 height=268 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Play both Lancelot 1 &amp; 2 in one complete game.\u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>The Chronicles of Lancelot: COMBO EDITION</strong> \u2013 the definitive gay RPG bundle where passion meets plot, magic meets muscles, and drama meets dungeon crawling!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/ddfe546915e027614e37e5cd6005f575.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Embark on a chaotic, heart-throbbing journey as Sir Lancelot \u2014 a dashing, occasionally dumb, always hot knight with a heart full of dreams (and maybe a few shirtless friends). In this outrageous blend of romance, betrayal, magic, and scandalous fun, you'll explore kingdoms, flirt with enemies, unlock secrets (and clothes), and maybe even save the world while getting lucky in the process. xD<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b6ac686931040145835724298cc27c65.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=578 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b6ac686931040145835724298cc27c65.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b6ac686931040145835724298cc27c65.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf08 FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Two full 3D gay RPGs</strong> in one bundle \u2013 over 30 hours of fabulous, fantasy gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/1df10f8e727d48e016d8e4728f493ca8.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa Meet, romance, and... <i>do things</i> with 15+ stunning male companions across both games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Use powerful magic, swing sexy swords, and survive hilariously inappropriate boss fights.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/94dfe52548c19216d3ee6245df44848b.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f Enjoy over <strong>30+ intimate, story-driven NSFW scenes</strong>, each more legendary than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/52c6599eb89c8d6a892935f72305fcd8.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=410 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/52c6599eb89c8d6a892935f72305fcd8.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/52c6599eb89c8d6a892935f72305fcd8.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc37 Ride dragons, escape dungeons, explore floating kingdoms, and flirt with shirtless elves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/5f38db3f6ecabe5701e8f3e9e644e806.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/5f38db3f6ecabe5701e8f3e9e644e806.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/5f38db3f6ecabe5701e8f3e9e644e806.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc83 Includes Gold Edition extras: Go-Go Boy Club, extra character &amp; dungeon, and the sizzling <i>Gawain</i> route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc Follow the tangled, dramatic love story between Lancelot and Prince Arthur \u2014 a pairing hotter than Excalibur in a lava bath.\ud83c\udfad </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/be4d909694d43ca7e851dc441465833f.webp?t=1753101609\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b5a84045b75f14cd8084fd5d889bb4d1.avif?t=1753101609\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a lavishly illustrated reimagining of Arthurian legend \u2014 a world where desire is as potent as destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/aff0111b242fec89bef71ea558baee58.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the realms of Camelot and beyond: from enchanted forests, ancient ruins, treacherous dungeons, and skybound kingdoms to the mythical treasure vaults of Avalon. Discover the floating empire of Pantheron and the hedonistic isle of Arcadion \u2014 a sanctuary where pleasure meets prophecy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b7615fb48dc98143f9fdbafdb1f8973d.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b55139becc3ce155f28e55228612624e.avif?t=1753101609\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lancelot\u2019s father, Ban, is accused of poisoning King Uther and Merlin with a cursed artifact known as <i>God\u2019s Tear</i>. Uther lies dead, Merlin in a coma, and Excalibur has vanished \u2014 right before Ban himself is slain.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/3999e5478a010c49e1e87eeb2bc7aff3.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=394 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with the realm on the brink of collapse, Lancelot must uncover the truth behind his father's legacy, navigating a maze of conspiracies, forbidden love, and ancient magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Mordred \u2014 the orphaned royal foster child with a vendetta against Uther\u2019s bloodline \u2014 escapes captivity and sets his own dark plans into motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though Prince Arthur secretly harbors love for Lancelot, circumstances spiral beyond control. Lancelot is imprisoned, and the man he loves signs his death sentence. What could have torn them apart?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/5730a0dd720d182421f141d74ba99690.avif?t=1753101609\" width=800 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/fd7caa12d0d2d5f6795ad1403b1c7808.avif?t=1753101609\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/ad50f252e76fd072810f2060ce86011f.avif?t=1753101609\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A knight of unmatched skill and reckless charm, hiding his loyal heart behind sharp wit and wilder desires. Forever caught in the power struggles of Camelot, he must face his past \u2014 and his feelings for Arthur \u2014 to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/224ab26599b10e1b901da3aef8478ebc.avif?t=1753101609\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The young Prince of Camelot \u2014 brave, noble, and hopelessly torn. With Uther dead and Merlin silenced, Arthur stands alone, a ruler without a guide, caught between the man he loves and the kingdom he must protect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/84ce4bfb1ae03f51ca48648065865a63.avif?t=1753101609\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fledgling guardian from the airborne realm of Pantheron. Jaime brought <i>God\u2019s Tear</i> to Earth in hopes of peace, only to find himself entangled in chaos. Well-meaning but impulsive, he complicates more than he resolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/78f4887d10be79ac847ec4f194eb600b.avif?t=1753101609\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stoic and fiercely loyal knight of the Round Table, secretly transgender. Asher shields Arthur from the shadowy threats within the court while guarding secrets of his own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/d4b643cd2243166cbb909220cc80dec9.avif?t=1753101609\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot-headed and proud, Kay grew up alongside Lancelot \u2014 once brothers-in-arms, now uneasy rivals. His father died after slaying Ban, leaving their bond haunted by blood and betrayal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Allies and Rivals:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lady of the Lake</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mysterious figure appears in the form desired by those who seek her. She\u2019s imprisoned deep beneath Avalon, and freeing her will be no small feat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mordred</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Takumi</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A treasure hunter from the East, Takumi attempts to steal Avalon\u2019s treasure map but gets caught and imprisoned in Camelot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thaloris</strong>: The charismatic merman steward of the Lady of the Lake provides crucial information about Avalon\u2019s treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taliesin</strong>: Camelot\u2019s eccentric scholar invents a flying ship to aid Lancelot on his journey to Pantheron. His poetic wit remains as sharp as ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innika</strong>: A fallen angel bound to the Archangel Ramiel, Innika serves as a reminder of the high cost of redemption.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that\u2019s just the beginning\u2014dozens more intriguing characters await to charm, challenge, and sometimes frustrate you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/152310f4322e3ad57ce468c94ec7e646.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/152310f4322e3ad57ce468c94ec7e646.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/152310f4322e3ad57ce468c94ec7e646.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc51 GENRES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NSFW Gay RPG \u2022 Visual Novel \u2022 Fantasy Adventure \u2022 Turn-Based Combat \u2022 Romance \u2022 Pervert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff3\ufe0f\u200d\ud83c\udf08 A GAME MADE FOR GAYS, BY GAYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever wanted to save the world with your shirt off, get railed in a magical forest, or flirt your way through a dungeon, this game is for you. With humor, heart, and a whole lot of homoerotic chaos, <i>Lancelot Combo</i> is a fantasy adventure where <i>every knight is Mr. Right (Now)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy the game now or prepare to be slain... with love. \ud83d\udc98</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This edition combines\u00a0The Chronicles of\u00a0Lancelot 1 and The Chronicles of Lancelot 2 into one unforgettable, deliciously NSFW fantasy adventure! xD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/0db579b0fd54f9d4bd2e6dbc462a3cb9.avif?t=1753101609\" width=600 height=268 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Play both Lancelot 1 &amp; 2 in one complete game.\u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>The Chronicles of Lancelot: COMBO EDITION</strong> \u2013 the definitive gay RPG bundle where passion meets plot, magic meets muscles, and drama meets dungeon crawling!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/ddfe546915e027614e37e5cd6005f575.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Embark on a chaotic, heart-throbbing journey as Sir Lancelot \u2014 a dashing, occasionally dumb, always hot knight with a heart full of dreams (and maybe a few shirtless friends). In this outrageous blend of romance, betrayal, magic, and scandalous fun, you'll explore kingdoms, flirt with enemies, unlock secrets (and clothes), and maybe even save the world while getting lucky in the process. xD<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b6ac686931040145835724298cc27c65.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=578 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b6ac686931040145835724298cc27c65.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b6ac686931040145835724298cc27c65.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf08 FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Two full 3D gay RPGs</strong> in one bundle \u2013 over 30 hours of fabulous, fantasy gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/1df10f8e727d48e016d8e4728f493ca8.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa Meet, romance, and... <i>do things</i> with 15+ stunning male companions across both games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Use powerful magic, swing sexy swords, and survive hilariously inappropriate boss fights.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/94dfe52548c19216d3ee6245df44848b.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f Enjoy over <strong>30+ intimate, story-driven NSFW scenes</strong>, each more legendary than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/52c6599eb89c8d6a892935f72305fcd8.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=410 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/52c6599eb89c8d6a892935f72305fcd8.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/52c6599eb89c8d6a892935f72305fcd8.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc37 Ride dragons, escape dungeons, explore floating kingdoms, and flirt with shirtless elves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/5f38db3f6ecabe5701e8f3e9e644e806.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/5f38db3f6ecabe5701e8f3e9e644e806.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/5f38db3f6ecabe5701e8f3e9e644e806.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc83 Includes Gold Edition extras: Go-Go Boy Club, extra character &amp; dungeon, and the sizzling <i>Gawain</i> route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc Follow the tangled, dramatic love story between Lancelot and Prince Arthur \u2014 a pairing hotter than Excalibur in a lava bath.\ud83c\udfad </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/be4d909694d43ca7e851dc441465833f.webp?t=1753101609\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b5a84045b75f14cd8084fd5d889bb4d1.avif?t=1753101609\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a lavishly illustrated reimagining of Arthurian legend \u2014 a world where desire is as potent as destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/aff0111b242fec89bef71ea558baee58.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the realms of Camelot and beyond: from enchanted forests, ancient ruins, treacherous dungeons, and skybound kingdoms to the mythical treasure vaults of Avalon. Discover the floating empire of Pantheron and the hedonistic isle of Arcadion \u2014 a sanctuary where pleasure meets prophecy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b7615fb48dc98143f9fdbafdb1f8973d.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b55139becc3ce155f28e55228612624e.avif?t=1753101609\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lancelot\u2019s father, Ban, is accused of poisoning King Uther and Merlin with a cursed artifact known as <i>God\u2019s Tear</i>. Uther lies dead, Merlin in a coma, and Excalibur has vanished \u2014 right before Ban himself is slain.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/3999e5478a010c49e1e87eeb2bc7aff3.avif?t=1753101609\" data-has-big width=800 height=394 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with the realm on the brink of collapse, Lancelot must uncover the truth behind his father's legacy, navigating a maze of conspiracies, forbidden love, and ancient magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Mordred \u2014 the orphaned royal foster child with a vendetta against Uther\u2019s bloodline \u2014 escapes captivity and sets his own dark plans into motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though Prince Arthur secretly harbors love for Lancelot, circumstances spiral beyond control. Lancelot is imprisoned, and the man he loves signs his death sentence. What could have torn them apart?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/5730a0dd720d182421f141d74ba99690.avif?t=1753101609\" width=800 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/fd7caa12d0d2d5f6795ad1403b1c7808.avif?t=1753101609\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/ad50f252e76fd072810f2060ce86011f.avif?t=1753101609\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A knight of unmatched skill and reckless charm, hiding his loyal heart behind sharp wit and wilder desires. Forever caught in the power struggles of Camelot, he must face his past \u2014 and his feelings for Arthur \u2014 to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/224ab26599b10e1b901da3aef8478ebc.avif?t=1753101609\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The young Prince of Camelot \u2014 brave, noble, and hopelessly torn. With Uther dead and Merlin silenced, Arthur stands alone, a ruler without a guide, caught between the man he loves and the kingdom he must protect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/84ce4bfb1ae03f51ca48648065865a63.avif?t=1753101609\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fledgling guardian from the airborne realm of Pantheron. Jaime brought <i>God\u2019s Tear</i> to Earth in hopes of peace, only to find himself entangled in chaos. Well-meaning but impulsive, he complicates more than he resolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/78f4887d10be79ac847ec4f194eb600b.avif?t=1753101609\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stoic and fiercely loyal knight of the Round Table, secretly transgender. Asher shields Arthur from the shadowy threats within the court while guarding secrets of his own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/d4b643cd2243166cbb909220cc80dec9.avif?t=1753101609\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot-headed and proud, Kay grew up alongside Lancelot \u2014 once brothers-in-arms, now uneasy rivals. His father died after slaying Ban, leaving their bond haunted by blood and betrayal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Allies and Rivals:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lady of the Lake</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mysterious figure appears in the form desired by those who seek her. She\u2019s imprisoned deep beneath Avalon, and freeing her will be no small feat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mordred</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Takumi</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A treasure hunter from the East, Takumi attempts to steal Avalon\u2019s treasure map but gets caught and imprisoned in Camelot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thaloris</strong>: The charismatic merman steward of the Lady of the Lake provides crucial information about Avalon\u2019s treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taliesin</strong>: Camelot\u2019s eccentric scholar invents a flying ship to aid Lancelot on his journey to Pantheron. His poetic wit remains as sharp as ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innika</strong>: A fallen angel bound to the Archangel Ramiel, Innika serves as a reminder of the high cost of redemption.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that\u2019s just the beginning\u2014dozens more intriguing characters await to charm, challenge, and sometimes frustrate you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/152310f4322e3ad57ce468c94ec7e646.poster.avif?t=1753101609\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/152310f4322e3ad57ce468c94ec7e646.webm?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773010/extras/152310f4322e3ad57ce468c94ec7e646.mp4?t=1753101609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc51 GENRES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NSFW Gay RPG \u2022 Visual Novel \u2022 Fantasy Adventure \u2022 Turn-Based Combat \u2022 Romance \u2022 Pervert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff3\ufe0f\u200d\ud83c\udf08 A GAME MADE FOR GAYS, BY GAYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever wanted to save the world with your shirt off, get railed in a magical forest, or flirt your way through a dungeon, this game is for you. With humor, heart, and a whole lot of homoerotic chaos, <i>Lancelot Combo</i> is a fantasy adventure where <i>every knight is Mr. Right (Now)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy the game now or prepare to be slain... with love. \ud83d\udc98</strong></p>",
